From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:35:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/29] Mobile: Add the shopping list core (data model,
 storage, crypto)

Pure, UI-free core for shared shopping lists: one record per item with
field-wise last-writer-wins merging, an own SQLite file next to Joplin's
database, device key pairs, open lists (shared key) and managed lists
(admins, per-member wrapped content key), invite links/codes, and
NIP-78 events encrypted with NIP-44 for the relay transport. Ships an
emoji icon catalog with German synonyms.

